    "detailed_description": "Intense VR Home Run Batter Game Begins Here!<br>The pitchers you'll face are famous characters from fairy tales. They'll throw absurd and unpredictable magic pitches. Stay in the ultimate state of concentration, the &quot;Zone,&quot; and hit home runs with precision!<br><br>*This game is recommended to be experienced in VR, but non-VR play is also supported (mouse &amp; keyboard control).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Only Home Runs Matter: <br>You should aim for nothing but home runs. Anything else is just a mistake.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unreasonable Magic Pitches:<br>The fairy tale characters show no mercy. Challenge yourself with extreme difficulty.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter the Zone:<br>By focusing your concentration to the extreme, time will feel slower. Enter the Zone and face the magic pitches.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Varied Bats and Growth Elements:<br>By using the money earned in the Home Run Batter, you can buy bats and items that will greatly enhance your hitting abilities.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Ideal for Live Streaming:<br>You can display the Live Chat that is being broadcast in-game!\u3000Let the whole world see your courage and have a great time!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2>If you enjoy the challenge of unreasonable difficulties, try clearing the game without using the Zone.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>Once upon a time, in a certain place...",
